WEBVTT

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:10.280
Transcending fate into a battle of destiny...

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:14.620
...the gong to start will now ring!

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:20.170
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:23.340
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:31.970
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:45.230
<i>The feelings after frustration</i>

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:50.740
<i>Are beyond my every choice</i>

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:56.370
<i>Resolve myself to not accept losing</i>

00:00:56.580 --> 00:01:01.420
<i>Then stand up onto a new stage</i>

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:06.960
<i>White, glistening sweat is beautiful</i>

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:12.340
<i>I decided I'll live my life</i>

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:15.220
<i>No matter how many times I fall</i>

00:01:15.430 --> 00:01:21.900
<i>If I stand up the same,</i>
<i>it will lead me to tomorrow</i>

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:24.610
<i>With a strong feeling to not lose</i>

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:27.820
<i>Say goodbye to the previous me</i>

00:01:28.030 --> 00:01:32.910
<i>A different me from yesterday is being born</i>

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:35.740
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:38.830
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:46.340
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:52.820
Episode 06: Revenge Match!

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:50.520
Sakura!

00:01:51.140 --> 00:01:52.770
Kazama!

00:01:55.350 --> 00:01:56.400
Here I go!

00:01:56.610 --> 00:01:58.020
Eat this!

00:01:59.940 --> 00:02:01.360
What?!

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:13.910
One...!

00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:15.540
Two...!

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:21.460
Kazama-<i>san</i> isn't standing up yet?!

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:23.970
Well then!

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:34.480
On a groove, eh?

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:36.810
Guess I better give ya something in return!

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:42.570
Here you go! Your favorite, Boston Crab!

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:48.530
Let's see you get out of this!

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:51.790
O-Owww...!

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:03.050
Oh?

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:05.880
A bit tougher now, eh?

00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:06.720
Well then...

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:08.720
How's this?!

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:10.350
Now!

00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:26.650
What?!

00:03:26.860 --> 00:03:29.030
Okay! Rope break!

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:33.870
Rio-<i>sama</i>!

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:40.750
She's a lot stronger now
than she was nine months ago...

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:44.590
The pain now is totally
different from nine months ago...

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:48.760
Kazama-<i>san</i> was going
easy with me back then...

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:57.390
One more!

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:01.980
It's not over yet!

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:12.200
She may have gotten stronger, but...

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:18.330
...she's still better fit
giving up to the Boston Crab!

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:25.250
I'm gonna finish this with the Boston Crab!

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:28.340
You're gonna learn
how weak you really are!

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:30.630
Ouch...!

00:04:36.180 --> 00:04:38.270
Her path got blocked!

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:41.390
Now then! There's
no way for you to move!

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:43.650
C'mon, give up!

00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:46.480
Do you give up, Hagiwara?

00:04:47.530 --> 00:04:48.280
Well?

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:51.150
Damn, you're persistent, Kazama!

00:04:51.360 --> 00:04:54.030
Please move, Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:56.450
Keep it up, Kazama!

00:04:57.240 --> 00:04:59.580
Keep the pressure on!

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:02.250
Sakura! Move! Move!

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:05.130
Put the squeeze on, Rio-<i>san</i>!

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:06.380
Hagiwara!

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:08.050
I'm going to stop the match!

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:10.130
Hagiwara, give up?

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:12.550
No...!

00:05:14.470 --> 00:05:16.350
No!

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:19.560
I'm not going to give up!

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:20.850
Sakura!

00:05:21.060 --> 00:05:22.480
Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:28.860
What?!

00:05:29.070 --> 00:05:31.530
She's still got juice in her?!

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:33.200
Damn it!

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:37.120
C'mon, give up! Give up!

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:38.200
No...!

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:40.910
Not gonna let you!

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:48.130
Th-The pain...!

00:05:48.340 --> 00:05:52.130
It's checkmate for you already!

00:05:52.340 --> 00:05:55.930
I'm gonna make you give up!

00:05:56.140 --> 00:05:59.970
No! I'm never going to give up!

00:06:00.970 --> 00:06:02.270
Sakura...

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:06.900
...ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra!

00:06:07.110 --> 00:06:15.820
Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra!
Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra!

00:06:16.030 --> 00:06:19.700
Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra!

00:06:19.910 --> 00:06:23.540
For the sake of everyone supporting me...!

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:25.750
For the sake of their cheers...!

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:30.050
I can't lose now...!

00:06:35.630 --> 00:06:38.260
This is the end!

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:41.890
No...! Not yet!

00:06:43.390 --> 00:06:51.400
Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra!
Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra!

00:06:51.610 --> 00:06:55.240
- Damn...!
- Hagiwara, you okay?

00:07:01.490 --> 00:07:02.990
Rope!

00:07:03.200 --> 00:07:05.580
Okay! Rope break!

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:19.590
N-Not yet...

00:07:20.510 --> 00:07:23.850
You held well... But...!

00:07:24.970 --> 00:07:27.600
I'll finish you with this instead!

00:07:33.230 --> 00:07:34.980
The Sleeper Hold!

00:07:35.190 --> 00:07:37.780
And with the added force of her swing!

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:41.070
What is this...?! My breath...!

00:07:41.280 --> 00:07:44.990
This'll put a squeeze on your neck!

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:48.420
I'll finish you off now!

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:53.460
This is my Rear Naked Choke!

00:07:55.460 --> 00:07:57.550
I-I can't stop moving...

00:07:57.760 --> 00:08:00.720
I... need to move...

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:08.140
Hey, ref! She's out cold!

00:08:08.350 --> 00:08:09.480
Hagiwara?

00:08:09.690 --> 00:08:11.650
Hey, Hagiwara!

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:21.280
Sakura-<i>chan</i>...!

00:08:21.490 --> 00:08:24.200
Ref! Stop the match!

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:40.550
Sakura!

00:08:43.930 --> 00:08:45.310
Never...

00:08:45.510 --> 00:08:47.520
...give up!

00:08:49.560 --> 00:08:51.900
What?! She's not done yet?!

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:54.770
Just give up already!

00:08:56.020 --> 00:09:00.070
I'm not giving up! I'm not going to lose!

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:11.920
Rope...!

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:14.250
Okay! Rope break!

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:17.500
She must've trained to get out of sleepers!

00:09:23.130 --> 00:09:24.970
That was close...

00:09:29.810 --> 00:09:33.810
Don't just stand there, you freaking rookie!

00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:40.740
One...!

00:09:40.940 --> 00:09:41.400
Two...!

00:09:41.610 --> 00:09:44.780
I'm not done with you yet!

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:50.330
One...!

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:51.960
Two...!

00:09:55.670 --> 00:09:56.750
Stop it already!

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:58.380
Hagiwara!

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:05.930
Now, this is the end!

00:10:15.350 --> 00:10:16.810
Endure...

00:10:17.020 --> 00:10:18.150
Endure...!

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:19.770
What?!

00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:25.280
Now! It's your turn now!

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:28.200
And, go for a comeback!

00:10:35.210 --> 00:10:37.170
Back at you!

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:43.970
Give up?

00:10:44.170 --> 00:10:46.010
Put the squeeze on!

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:48.640
Move! Move...!

00:10:49.430 --> 00:10:51.810
D-Damn it...!

00:10:53.770 --> 00:10:55.600
I won't let you go!

00:10:57.230 --> 00:10:59.560
Damn, the pain!

00:10:59.770 --> 00:11:01.190
Give up?!

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:04.070
Hell no!

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:06.900
No?! How's this then?!

00:11:12.740 --> 00:11:16.080
Rope...! Hey ref! I've got the rope!

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:18.710
Okay! Hagiwara, rope break!

00:11:21.090 --> 00:11:23.090
Not over yet!

00:11:42.650 --> 00:11:45.280
Referee! She's out!

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:50.410
Damn...

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:53.530
...it!

00:11:53.740 --> 00:11:55.160
Okay!

00:12:09.760 --> 00:12:11.090
Sakura!

00:12:11.300 --> 00:12:13.890
Now's your chance, Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:17.270
I'm going to win!

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:27.780
One...!

00:12:27.990 --> 00:12:29.110
Two...!

00:12:29.320 --> 00:12:32.280
Oh, man! This'll be
a huge win for Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:37.450
Here I go!

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:41.830
- Go for it!
- Go for it!

00:12:52.050 --> 00:12:53.590
One...!

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:55.300
No freakin' way...!

00:12:55.510 --> 00:12:59.230
I put four long years
under my belt just to get here!

00:12:59.430 --> 00:13:00.390
Two...!

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:03.310
I'm not going to be put down...

00:13:06.610 --> 00:13:10.700
...by a rookie like you!

00:13:16.580 --> 00:13:17.990
Sakura!

00:13:22.120 --> 00:13:27.420
I can't... lose... here...

00:13:29.840 --> 00:13:33.340
After the relentless
battle, a double knock down!

00:13:33.550 --> 00:13:34.510
Can they get back up?!

00:13:34.720 --> 00:13:38.220
Who's going to make their stand?!

00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:39.970
One!

00:13:41.980 --> 00:13:43.390
Two!

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:51.140
Three!

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:53.640
Four!

00:13:54.890 --> 00:13:56.310
Five!

00:13:57.390 --> 00:13:58.810
Six!

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:01.020
Elena...

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:02.860
Misaki-<i>san...</i>

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:05.020
Everyone...!

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:08.530
Sakura...

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:10.320
Sakura!

00:14:12.070 --> 00:14:15.080
Sakura! Wake up!

00:14:15.280 --> 00:14:17.500
Stand up!

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:19.370
- Elena...
- Seven!

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:22.290
Eight!

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:23.920
Nine!

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:29.590
I'm...

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:32.090
I'm going to win!

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:34.430
Sakura...!

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:38.390
I'm not gonna lose!

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:40.600
I can't lose!

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:42.440
Hagiwara!

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:45.110
Rio-<i>sama</i>!

00:14:45.310 --> 00:14:48.070
You're awesome, Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:08.710
Sakura!

00:15:10.170 --> 00:15:11.550
Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:13.470
Isn't that...?!

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:22.100
Don't know what
you're planning there, but...

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:24.650
...I'm the one who's going to win!

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:33.780
What?!

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:42.370
Here I go...!

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:50.050
I'm not done...!

00:15:57.090 --> 00:15:57.930
That's...

00:15:58.140 --> 00:15:59.060
- The Ice Cream...
- The Ice Cream...

00:15:59.260 --> 00:16:00.680
Sault!

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:15.110
Hagiwara's powerful
two-hit combo got Kazama's jaw!

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:16.740
I've never seen a

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:18.530
- Rio?
- backward somersault with a kick before!

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:20.240
- Rio?
- A true special move!

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:23.410
- Rio?
- A true, Sakura Special!

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:28.630
We've just witnessed
the birth of a powerful move!

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:30.590
It worked...!

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:36.180
Sakura! Pin her!

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:43.350
- One...!
- One...!

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:45.560
Two...!

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:47.980
Rio-<i>san</i>!

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:50.310
- Three!
- Three!

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:56.030
Hagiwara finally wins!

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:59.570
She wins with a three
count from her rival of fate!

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:05.410
The gong is an echo of
praise for her glorious victory!

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:07.000
Sa-ku-ra!

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:11.710
Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra!

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:15.380
- I... I won...
- Sa-ku-ra!

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:17.130
Sakura!

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:19.470
Her sixty-sixth match from her pro debut...

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:23.600
A long, long awaited first win!

00:17:23.810 --> 00:17:26.850
The entire stadium is
filled with the calls for Sakura!

00:17:27.640 --> 00:17:29.100
Wow...

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:32.650
Everyone is calling my name...

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:34.940
This is pro wrestling...

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:36.650
The sense of accomplishment...

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:38.360
The sense of fulfillment...

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:40.490
This is winning!

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:42.530
I want to win again!

00:17:43.530 --> 00:17:48.370
I want to become stronger!

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:51.500
Rio-<i>san</i>! Rio-<i>san</i>!

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:54.000
Quit it with all the screaming.

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:56.420
I can hear you.

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:59.300
I guess I lost.

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:00.890
Rio-<i>san...</i>

00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:05.010
Damn it... The lights are so damn bright...

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:08.770
Hagiwara!

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:14.820
You're...

00:18:15.020 --> 00:18:16.900
...a lot stronger now.

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:21.360
I'll take this loss today!

00:18:21.570 --> 00:18:24.870
You're not half bad for being an idol!

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:27.080
But, now that you've beaten me,

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:30.660
what are you going
to do with pro wrestling?

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:34.380
You were doing this to beat me, right?

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:36.380
Now that you've met your goal,

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:38.760
what are you going to do now?

00:18:45.550 --> 00:18:46.970
Sakura...

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:53.350
I was frustrated with Kazama
making fun of idols, of Sweet Diva.

00:18:53.560 --> 00:18:56.650
That led me to challenge
the world of pro wrestling.

00:18:56.860 --> 00:19:01.200
I wanted to beat Kazama
before I returned to Sweet Diva.

00:19:01.400 --> 00:19:03.610
Or, that's what I thought...

00:19:03.820 --> 00:19:05.740
But reality was harsh...

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:08.370
The world of wrestling wasn't easy.

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:12.120
It was sad seeing
how I couldn't do anything.

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:14.790
I kept thinking about giving up...

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:22.090
But, each time I felt
myself getting stronger...

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:26.260
...the urge to become
stronger grew inside me.

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:31.310
And today, I finally
won, and now I know...!

00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:34.140
Sakura...?

00:19:34.350 --> 00:19:36.150
I want to win again!

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:39.150
I want to become stronger!

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:41.440
So...

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:47.570
I like pro wrestling now!

00:19:47.780 --> 00:19:49.370
I want to...

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:51.700
...continue pro wrestling!

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:56.500
All right, Hagiwara!

00:19:56.710 --> 00:19:59.710
That's right! You're a pro wrestler now!

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:02.170
Chairman... Sakura-<i>chan</i> is...

00:20:02.380 --> 00:20:05.300
Don't cry! It's what Sakura-<i>chan</i> decided!

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:09.100
All we can do now is cheer her on!

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:10.680
No...

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:13.810
Isn't Sakura intending to come back...?

00:20:14.020 --> 00:20:15.980
Wh-Why?

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:19.650
Elena?

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:26.110
Now you're talkin'!

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:31.120
I'm not letting you run with the win!

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:33.250
This isn't going to happen again!

00:20:33.450 --> 00:20:36.670
Yes! I won't lose either.

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:42.840
Rio-<i>san</i>...!

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:45.760
Huh?

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:57.810
Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra!

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:01.190
<i>Three, Two, One, and here we go!</i>
<i>Let's shoot for the greatest stage</i>

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:03.940
<i>Dancing & singing, let's liven things up!</i>

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:08.700
<i>Together it's a brand new day,</i>
<i>c'mon everyone's cheers are</i>

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:11.580
<i>Fan! Fanfare!!!</i>

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:21.250
<i>Dreams are our heart's sun</i>

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:26.880
<i>Let's make them real with our magic</i>

00:21:27.090 --> 00:21:32.350
<i>Fashion, makeup, but inside's a passion</i>

00:21:32.550 --> 00:21:36.390
<i>to a bright future</i>

00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:37.520
<i>Step up!!</i>

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:40.190
<i>The spotlight shines</i>

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:42.860
<i>Microphone stand, fluttering skirts</i>

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:50.240
<i>The heart's rhythm, swing</i>
<i>swing, notes dance, it's show time!!</i>

00:21:50.450 --> 00:21:56.370
<i>Watch me be No. 1 someday, your No. 1</i>

00:21:56.580 --> 00:21:57.580
<i>Let's sing (All day long)</i>

00:21:57.790 --> 00:21:59.210
<i>Let's dance (All night long)</i>

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:07.300
<i>With all my love,</i>
<i>more than being first, your smile</i>

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:08.920
<i>is what I want to see (Hold me tight)</i>

00:22:09.130 --> 00:22:12.890
<i>Let's make true my dream</i>

00:22:13.100 --> 00:22:14.140
<i>Anytime, do my best</i>

00:22:14.350 --> 00:22:15.680
<i>Do your best and don't give up</i>

00:22:15.890 --> 00:22:18.180
<i>Dancing & singing, as yourself</i>

00:22:18.390 --> 00:22:19.640
<i>If you like it, it's all fine</i>

00:22:19.850 --> 00:22:23.230
<i>The beat in your heart is your answer</i>

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:26.070
<i>Fan! Fanfare!!!</i>

00:22:28.440 --> 00:22:33.160
Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra!

00:23:10.720 --> 00:23:35.350
Episode 07: The World Champion Comes to Japan!

00:23:11.150 --> 00:23:14.450
Congrats to Sakura-<i>chan</i>'s first win!

00:23:14.660 --> 00:23:18.160
See, Chief? The day finally arrived!

00:23:18.370 --> 00:23:21.120
Girls' pro wrestling is on a roll now!

00:23:21.330 --> 00:23:24.120
To add, the world champ is coming to Japan!

00:23:24.330 --> 00:23:25.750
Jackall Tojo!

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:29.090
Her popularity, skills, and body are top notch!

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:31.260
Gotta keep an eye on the special match against Misaki!

00:23:31.470 --> 00:23:33.470
But, who would've expected that?!

00:23:33.680 --> 00:23:35.140
What's going to happen now?

00:23:35.350 --> 00:23:40.190
A request from Sakura:

00:23:35.350 --> 00:23:40.190
There are a lot of pro wrestling moves in "Sekatsuyo,"
but they're dangerous, so please don't try them at home!
